  "title": "Celebrate the MATKP world premiere at ADA!",
  "bodyHtml": "<p>Our team is thrilled to announce the public debut of the Mammalian Adipose Tissue Knowledge Portal (MATKP). MATKP will be unveiled through a presentation at the 2025 American Diabetes Association (ADA) conference in Chicago, IL. The presentation will be held in the session, \"Mechanisms Linking Adipose Health with Lipid and Glucose Homeostasis\" on Friday, June 20, 2025, from 5:45-6:00 PM in the McCormick Place Convention Center, West Building, Room W186 A-C. Come visit us at our ADA Booth #948 for MATKP Day on Saturday 6/21 from 12:00-2:00 PM!</p>",
  "summary": "Our team is thrilled to announce the public debut of the Mammalian Adipose Tissue Knowledge Portal (MATKP)! MATKP will be unveiled through a presentation and exhibition booth at the 2025 American Diabetes Association (ADA) conference in Chicago, IL. See the full article for details.",
